{{#is_alert}}
## What's happening?

The average admission wait time for ClusterQueue **{{kueue_cluster_queue.name}}** is {{value}} seconds, above the critical threshold of {{threshold}} seconds. Workloads are waiting too long between creation/requeue and admission.

> **Note:** This monitor approximates p95 wait time using the ratio of `kueue.admission.wait_time.seconds.sum` to `kueue.admission.wait_time.seconds.count` (an average-based proxy), because native percentile/quantile aggregation over Prometheus histogram buckets is not directly expressible in this query. If you need a true p95, build a histogram_quantile-style calculation on the `.bucket` submetric in a dashboard and adjust this monitor's threshold based on observed skew between average and p95.
{{/is_alert}}

{{#is_warning}}
## What's happening?

The average admission wait time for ClusterQueue **{{kueue_cluster_queue.name}}** is {{value}} seconds, above the warning threshold of {{warn_threshold}} seconds.
{{/is_warning}}

{{#is_recovery}}
## Recovered

Admission wait time for ClusterQueue {{kueue_cluster_queue.name}} has resolved. Current value: {{value}} seconds.
{{/is_recovery}}
